app/router.tsx: Customer area = Customer | Investor (an Investor may pre-order like a Customer; the delivery-address page is still Customer-only, a gap for investors who pre-order); Investor portal = Investor; Operator workspace = OperatorMember (+ operator_id claim); Admin console = PlatformAdmin | EvidenceReviewer. A 401 from the API logs the user out.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Removed in v1.4 (still in code)&lt;/b&gt;: Store · listing detail /cua-hang/:listingId?, Products /san-pham, Trace crab by tag /truy-xuat/:tagCode, Cart /gio-hang, Checkout /thanh-toan, Order confirmation /xac-nhan-don-hang, Pre-order by listing /dat-truoc/:listingId (replaced by Bulk pre-order).&lt;br&gt;Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt; (not UML; routes as in web/src/app/router.tsx and mobile/lib/app/routes.dart on develop @ 420a379) — box = screen (name, route); dashed grey with «planned» = screen in Register v1.4 with no route on develop; grey line &quot;v1.4: … «planned»&quot; = the screen exists, the v1.4 additions are not built yet; dotted rounded box = link to another figure or part." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="828" width="1546" height="127" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Web 1 – Investor portal (2 of 2)" id="Web_1___Investor_portal__2_of_2_"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1440" pageHeight="750" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 3.1a – Screen Flow: web application – public, Customer and Investor areas (part 2 of 2: Investor portal)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/