lor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c19" target="c20"><mxGeometry x="0.0000" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="34" value="low-grade, resale, final" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#64748b;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;fontColor=#64748b;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c20" target="c21"><mxGeometry x="0.0000" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="35" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Segoe UI;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c18" target="c22"><mxGeometry x="0.0000" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="928" y="529"/><mxPoint x="928" y="935"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="36" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; — Every screen of the workspace is reachable from the sidebar menu; arrows show the main task paths only. Operator registration is open to any signed-in user before approval.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Removed in v1.4 (still in code)&lt;/b&gt;: Tags · label print · void /operator/tags, Listings · price /operator/listings, tag scanning when packing an order in /operator/orders/:orderNo, water-quality thresholds (pH, temperature, salinity) in Batch detail /operator/batch/detail.&lt;br&gt;Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt; (not UML; routes as in web/src/app/router.tsx and mobile/lib/app/routes.dart on develop @ 420a379) — box = screen (name, route); dashed grey with «planned» = screen in Register v1.4 with no route on develop; grey line &quot;v1.4: … «planned»&quot; = the screen exists, the v1.4 additions are not built yet; dotted rounded box = link to another figure or part." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="986" y="80" width="430" height="247" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Web 3 – Admin console" id="Web_3___Admin_console"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1440" pageHeight="840" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 3.1c – Screen Flow: web application – Admin console (roles PlatformAdmin | EvidenceReviewer)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1040" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="&lt;b&gt;Admin console&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;the sidebar menu reaches every screen&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#94a3b8;dashed=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontStyle=0;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="340" y="80" width="616" height="727" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;b&gt;Dashboard · CSV reports&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;/admin&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;ar