e?tagCode=, tag scanning when packing /o/pack/:orderNo, water-quality thresholds and readings (pH, temperature, salinity) in New daily log /o/log/new.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt; (not UML; routes as in web/src/app/router.tsx and mobile/lib/app/routes.dart on develop @ 420a379) — box = screen (name, route); dashed grey with «planned» = screen in Register v1.4 with no route on develop; grey line &quot;v1.4: … «planned»&quot; = the screen exists, the v1.4 additions are not built yet; dotted rounded box = link to another figure or part." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1386" y="180" width="430" height="262" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>